    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "A deadly zombie virus is spreading fast. The only vaccine is hidden on
    an island swarming with the undead.\n\nYou\u2019re infected\u2014and your time
    is running out. Reach the island, get the vaccine, or become one of them. Use
    medicine to slow the infection. If it hits 100, it\u2019s game over.\n\n\nControls:\n\nWASD
    \u2013 Move\nShift (Hold) \u2013 Run\nC (Hold) \u2013 Crouch\nLeft Mouse \u2013
    Attack\nRight Mouse \u2013 Aim\nB \u2013 Inventory Menu"
